24:["$","p","p-6",{"children":["A concrete HTTP contract is ",["$","code","code-0",{"children":"PATCH /documents/42"}]," with ",["$","code","code-1",{"children":"If-Match: \"v7\""}],". On a successful conditional update, return ",["$","code","code-2",{"children":"ETag: \"v8\""}],"; on a stale precondition, return ",["$","code","code-3",{"children":"412 Precondition Failed"}]," and let the authorized client fetch the current version. The editor's next read must route to the primary or a replica known to have reached v8. ",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Reference/Headers/If-Match","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":["HTTP ",["$","code","code-0",{"children":"If-Match"}]]}]," is a useful protocol tool, but the database conditional write remains the enforcement point. During a partition, do not confirm an edit that the authoritative write path could not commit."]}]
